 clipboard:'<rect x="8" y="3" width="8" height="4" rx="1"/><path d="M16 5h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/><path d="M9 13l2 2 4-4"/>',
